---
source: crates/cosmon-cli/tests/help_goldens.rs
expression: stdout
---
Observe or attach an exact worker terminal (read-only by default)

Usage: cs terminal [OPTIONS] <MOLECULE_ID>

Arguments:
  <MOLECULE_ID>
          Complete molecule ID; prefixes are refused

Options:
      --attach
          Attach using the selected mode (default: output only, no worker resize)

      --config <PATH>
          Path to the state directory (default: the galaxy's .cosmon/state/)

      --mode <MODE>
          Explicit input capability; interactive dimensions may resize the worker

          Possible values:
          - read-only:   Output only, with no worker size or environment influence
          - interactive: Literal human input and output; contributes terminal dimensions
          
          [default: read-only]

  -v, --verbose
          Enable verbose output

      --expect <TOKEN>
          Incarnation token returned by a fresh terminal observation

      --json
          Output in JSON format

  -h, --help
          Print help (see a summary with '-h')
